        "text_C2c5pX": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Why do you name it \"Rechargeable SlM Card\"?</p>",
            "text_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_gradient_background": "",
            "text_font_size": 36,
            "text_font_weight": 400,
            "text_line_height": 1.2,
            "text_align": "left",
            "max_text_container_max_width": 52,
            "enable_text_underline": false,
            "text_underline_width": 100,
            "text_underline_height": 2,
            "text_underline_gradient_background": "",
            "direction_x": "ltr",
            "direction_y": "ttb",
            "position_x": 18,
            "position_y": 17.4
          }
        },
        "text_R5c6cj": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>After the first data package is used up, you can turn to GlocalMe to buy another data package to add on to the SlM card and don' t need to buy a new SlM. It is reusable. Besides, we provide customized packages and renewal services.</p>",
            "text_color": "#4b4b4b",
            "text_gradient_background": "",
            "text_font_size": 36,
            "text_font_weight": 400,
            "text_line_height": 1.2,
            "text_align": "left",
            "max_text_container_max_width": 52,
            "enable_text_underline": false,
            "text_underline_width": 100,
            "text_underline_height": 2,
            "text_underline_gradient_background": "",
            "direction_x": "ltr",
            "direction_y": "ttb",
            "position_x": 26,
            "position_y": 28
          }
        },
        "text_O2c5cI": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Does GlocalMe WiFi device supports SlM card?</p>",
            "text_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_gradient_background": "",
            "text_font_size": 36,
            "text_font_weight": 400,
            "text_line_height": 1.2,
            "text_align": "left",
            "max_text_container_max_width": 52,
            "enable_text_underline": false,
            "text_underline_width": 100,
            "text_underline_height": 2,
            "text_underline_gradient_background": "",
            "direction_x": "ltr",
            "direction_y": "ttb",
            "position_x": 18,
            "position_y": 50
          }
        },
        "text_J7c3cT": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>No, currently SlM card cannot be used in the GlocalMe WiFi devices, needs to be inserted into mobile phone to use.</p>",
            "text_color": "#4b4b4b",
            "text_gradient_background": "",
            "text_font_size": 36,
            "text_font_weight": 400,
            "text_line_height": 1.2,
            "text_align": "left",
            "max_text_container_max_width": 52,
            "enable_text_underline": false,
            "text_underline_width": 100,
            "text_underline_height": 2,
            "text_underline_gradient_background": "",
            "direction_x": "ltr",
            "direction_y": "ttb",
            "position_x": 26,
            "position_y": 58
          }
        },
        "text_N2c5p7": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Does the rechargeable GlocalMe SlM Card connected to the same networks as the device does?</p>",
            "text_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_gradient_background": "",
            "text_font_size": 36,
            "text_font_weight": 400,
            "text_line_height": 1.2,
            "text_align": "left",
            "max_text_container_max_width": 56,
            "enable_text_underline": false,
            "text_underline_width": 100,
            "text_underline_height": 2,
            "text_underline_gradient_background": "",
            "direction_x": "ltr",
            "direction_y": "ttb",
            "position_x": 18,
            "position_y": 72.6
          }
        },
        "text_F8c3i5": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>No, the network operator will be determined when the SlM is activated while the device can select the optimal network signal at anytime.</p>",
            "text_color": "#4b4b4b",
            "text_gradient_background": "",
            "text_font_size": 36,
